classDiagram
    class Task {
        +str title
        +str time
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +str due_date
        +mark_complete()
        +next_occurrence() Task?
    }
    note for Task "next_occurrence() returns None\nwhen frequency is 'once'"

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +int age
        +List~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task)
        +remove_task(title)
        +get_pending_tasks() List~Task~
    }

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +List~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet)
        +get_all_tasks() List~Task~
        +get_pet(name) Pet
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +get_all_tasks() List~Task~
        +sort_by_time(tasks?) List~Task~
        +filter_by_pet(pet_name) List~Task~
        +filter_by_status(completed=False) List~Task~
        +detect_conflicts() List~str~
        +mark_task_complete(pet_name, task_title) Task?
        +build_daily_schedule() List~dict~
    }
    note for Scheduler "mark_task_complete() marks the old\ntask complete, then creates and returns\nthe NEXT occurrence (or None if not\nrecurring). detect_conflicts() flags\nexact same-time matches only.\nbuild_daily_schedule() includes only\npending tasks."

    Owner "1" --> "many" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" --> "many" Task : has
    Scheduler "1" --> "1" Owner : manages
    Scheduler ..> Task : creates next occurrence
    Scheduler ..> Pet : adds recurring task

